# Photo originals. 121MB of full-resolution frames that no visitor ever
# receives — the browser only ever gets the derivatives — and a public repo
# offers them all up behind a Download ZIP button. They live on disk here and
# in R2; scripts/optimize-photos.js turns them into the derivatives it uploads,
# and commits src/generated/photos.json, which is what the build reads.
src/photos/

